// Central SEO metadata: the single source of truth for per-route title, description,
// robots and schema. Consumed by:
//   - src/components/Seo.jsx          (head tags, by location.pathname; page props are overrides)
//   - src/seo/RouteSeo.jsx            (routes whose page renders no <SEO>, and all non-public routes)
//   - scripts/generate-sitemap.mjs    (sitemap = every indexable entry below)
//   - scripts/check-seo.mjs           (build fails on duplicate titles/descriptions, bad canonicals, etc.)
//
// Entry fields:
//   title, description  required for indexable routes (description <= 160 chars)
//   robots              "noindex,nofollow" for anything that must stay out of search
//   canonical           optional; must equal the route key (self-referencing) when set
//   schema              optional list of schema types (see src/seo/schema.js); default MedicalWebPage + BreadcrumbList
//   lastmod             YYYY-MM-DD of the last real content change (seeded from the git date of the page file)
//   global              true when the page component renders no <SEO> itself and <RouteSeo/> must emit its tags
//
// Keys are lowercase, no trailing slash. Seeded from keywords.xlsx (flat slugs mapped to live routes);
// routes the sheet did not cover use the page's previous copy or hand-written text.

